  "_README": [
    "Copy this file to data/extras.json to add content that is not in the SRD.",
    "",
    "extras.json is loaded automatically when present and merges into the core",
    "data. Entries with a new id are ADDED; entries reusing an existing id",
    "REPLACE the core entry.",
    "",
    "The repo already ships a data/extras.json holding the 12 Player's Handbook",
    "backgrounds and the 6 Origin feats they grant, so all 16 backgrounds work",
    "out of the box. Edit that file to add more.",
    "",
    "To keep an addition off GitHub, put it in a separate file and add that",
    "filename to .gitignore.",
    "",
